The Tylertoo-* Vale rules come from nlebovits/geodata-llm-eval
(styles/Geodata-*), which adapted them from the Portolan prose rules:

  https://github.com/portolan-sdi/portolan-ops
  commit ae93b7c7c23ddb9661292f621243896c3e23c25e

  https://github.com/nlebovits/geodata-llm-eval
  commit 8f320c0168af80016bae9224c10c6a6400b202d9

They remain available under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE
at the repository root). For tylertoo the styles were renamed, the
Headings exceptions and Casing swaps were replaced with this project's
terms, and each rule's examples moved into its `tests:` block for
`vale test`.
